  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/udon-networking\n> When creating your logic to allow transfer of Ownership by using SetReturnValue to return true/false when OnOwnershipRequest is triggered, it's helpful to know that this actually runs locally, on the client of whomever called Networking.SetOwner. \nIt was my understanding that OnOwnershipRequest was queried on the prior owner, not on whatever client called Networking.SetOwner (who might not be either the new or old owner). Is this documentation correct?",
